1414	/**
1415	 * POST /api/documents/:id/verify
1416	 *
1417	 * **DEPRECATED — KS-48 (option A).** Use `POST /api/verification/verify` instead.
1418	 * This endpoint is owner-scoped (the doc must be in the caller's tenant);
1419	 * the public `/api/verification/verify` resolves cross-tenant via the
1420	 * platform document registry and is the canonical verify path used by
1421	 * the verifier portal, the SSD connector (`SecuuraApi.verifyDocument`),
1422	 * and any cross-environment workflow. RFC 8594 `Deprecation` + `Sunset` +
1423	 * `Link: rel="successor-version"` headers are set on every response so
1424	 * any remaining caller can spot the deprecation in logs / dev-tools.
